{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/1a7d4842b469b14c5e37fe1721362119.avif?t=1760812186\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/e43300a668e22c43222b0d14abf0cc3f.poster.avif?t=1760812186\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/e43300a668e22c43222b0d14abf0cc3f.webm?t=1760812186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/e43300a668e22c43222b0d14abf0cc3f.mp4?t=1760812186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play at your own pace, explore freely while enjoying small details of Mediterranean nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse land, sea and sky, and collect the memories along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENJOY THE MOMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/b78d815d1e505e56cfde567e36ec89f7.poster.avif?t=1760812186\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/b78d815d1e505e56cfde567e36ec89f7.webm?t=1760812186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/b78d815d1e505e56cfde567e36ec89f7.mp4?t=1760812186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Feel the hot summer day, breathe in fresh smell of the pine trees, jump into crystal clear sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice the small details around you and learn to just live in the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET THE SPIRIT OF THE WILDERNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirits inspired by old Croatian folk tales are all around you, can you find them all? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about them and unravel their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/00cd07525ce2c34e9303f0b3dbfe7e83.poster.avif?t=1760812186\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/00cd07525ce2c34e9303f0b3dbfe7e83.webm?t=1760812186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/extras/00cd07525ce2c34e9303f0b3dbfe7e83.mp4?t=1760812186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the tale about growing up and overcoming the challenges of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn Croatian and Mediterranean legends first-hand from the creatures that inhabit them and discover lost cultural monuments and traditions.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2006540?t=1760812186","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2006540?t=1760812186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/479884f7305fbe46e1327470d1e3e470f1ec320e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760812186","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2006540/479884f7305fbe46e1327470d1e3e470f1ec320e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760812186","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements